{"id":"1d735fa5476ec4af","group":"93","path":"93/93-fact-modular-identity.md","title":"Modular Identity","display":"Modular Identity","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-fact-modular-identity","aliases":["93-fact-modular-identity"],"display":"Modular Identity","depends_on":["[[93-df-modular]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-fact-modular-identity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-fact-modular-identity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Modular Identity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0c4f99f2719ded5b\" href=\"?note=0c4f99f2719ded5b\" title=\"93-df-modular\">93-df-modular</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ModLat}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{ModLat}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span>, where <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ModLat}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{ModLat}_{93}\\)</span> is the predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0c4f99f2719ded5b\" href=\"?note=0c4f99f2719ded5b\" title=\"93-df-modular\">93-df-modular</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z\\in|\\mathbf A|\">\\(x,y,z\\in|\\mathbf A|\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\leq_{\\mathbf A}z\">\\(x\\leq_{\\mathbf A}z\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}modular\\text{-}identity}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ModLat}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\land x,y,z\\in|\\mathbf A|\\land x\\leq_{\\mathbf A}z\\to x\\vee^{\\mathbf A}(y\\wedge^{\\mathbf A}z)=(x\\vee^{\\mathbf A}y)\\wedge^{\\mathbf A}z\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}modular\\text{-}identity}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ModLat}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\land x,y,z\\in|\\mathbf A|\\land x\\leq_{\\mathbf A}z\\to x\\vee^{\\mathbf A}(y\\wedge^{\\mathbf A}z)=(x\\vee^{\\mathbf A}y)\\wedge^{\\mathbf A}z\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>This is the modular law under its essential side condition <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\le z\">\\(x\\le z\\)</span>.\nThe previous unconditional formula was a distributivity-like identity and\ndoes not characterize modular lattices.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-modular","status":"resolved","id":"0c4f99f2719ded5b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-modular]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-modular","status":"resolved","id":"0c4f99f2719ded5b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ModLat}_{93}(\\mathbf A)$, where $\\mathrm{ModLat}_{93}$ is the predicate of [[93-df-modular]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ModLat}_{93}(\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ModLat}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"x,y,z\\in|\\mathbf A|","display":false},{"tex":"x\\leq_{\\mathbf A}z","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}modular\\text{-}identity}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ModLat}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\land x,y,z\\in|\\mathbf A|\\land x\\leq_{\\mathbf A}z\\to x\\vee^{\\mathbf A}(y\\wedge^{\\mathbf A}z)=(x\\vee^{\\mathbf A}y)\\wedge^{\\mathbf A}z","display":true},{"tex":"x\\le z","display":false}],"bytes":835,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["0c4f99f2719ded5b"]}